\header {
  texidoc = "In a measure beginning with cadenza material, if a bar
line is added at the end of the cadenza, its bar number is
parenthesized even though the cadenza does not advance
@code{measurePosition}.

The first staff tests this at the start of the first and following
measures of a piece.  The second staff tests this before an initial
anacrusis."
}

